Package: IndividualGuide
Title: Low-Code Analytical Pipeline Builder
Version: 0.7.0
URL: https://github.com/woodtho/IndividualGuide
BugReports: https://github.com/woodtho/IndividualGuide/issues
Authors@R:
    person("Thomas", "Wood", email = "thomaswood1994@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Thomas Wood [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Thomas Wood <thomaswood1994@gmail.com>
Description: A Shiny application that replicates the core workflow of
    GUI analytics tools in R. Users build analytical pipelines by
    connecting tasks in a graphical canvas; each task generates readable R
    code behind the scenes. Launch the application with run_app().
